15. WINNING AND LOSING

At the end of Day 8, calculate a final campaign result.

Possible endings:

GREEN RECOVERY
The city has become safer, electricity is stable, and environmental conditions have improved substantially.

SURVIVED, BUT STILL STRUGGLING
The city has avoided complete disaster, but some problems remain unresolved.

ELECTRICITY BLACKOUT
Energy stability has fallen below a critical threshold, and essential services are severely affected.

CLIMATE EMERGENCY
Multiple critical indicators have deteriorated, leaving the city unable to adequately protect its citizens.

The ending must be determined by the player’s accumulated results. Use transparent thresholds and meaningful consequences.

